            <ArticleTitle>An uncommon congenital anomaly of the ribs.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>240-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4103/0970-2113.177447</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Intrathoracic rib is an extremely rare congenital anomaly of the ribs. Here, we present the case of a 10-year-old boy with asthma who, on routine evaluation, was found to have this anomaly.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
